inline_comments.body:
![critical](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/critical.svg)

The alignment check only considers `src_inblock_offset`. However, the vectorized `float4` copy in the `else` block requires 16-byte alignment for both source and destination. If `token_stride` (which is `head_dim`) is not a multiple of 16, `dst_inblock_offset` could also be misaligned, leading to a crash. The alignment check should cover both source and destination offsets to ensure correctness.

```
  if ((src_inblock_offset & (VEC_SIZE-1)) || (dst_inblock_offset & (VEC_SIZE-1))) {
    float* p_dst = reinterpret_cast<float*>(dst_k) + dst_inblock_offset / 4;
    const float* p_src = reinterpret_cast<const float*>(kv_cache) + src_inblock_offset / 4;
    for (int j=0; j<4; j++)
      p_dst[j] = p_src[j];
  } else {
    reinterpret_cast<float4*>(dst_k)[dst_inblock_offset / VEC_SIZE] =
        reinterpret_cast<const float4*>(kv_cache)[src_inblock_offset / VEC_SIZE];
  }
```

